# Contributing

## Branches

- `main` is protected. Never push to it directly.
- Create one branch per task from an up-to-date `main`.
- Name it after the backlog ID: `feature/PB-01-F-01`, `fix/PB-04-F-02`.

## Commits

- Short, imperative messages: `Add CameraX capture screen`.
- Reference the issue when relevant: `Closes #4`.

## Pull Requests

1. Push your branch and open a PR against `main`.
2. Fill in the PR template.
3. Wait for the CI checks (Sonar, Detekt) to pass.
4. At least one team member other than the author must approve.
5. Resolve all review conversations, then merge (squash merge recommended).
6. Delete the branch after merging.

## Code quality

- Code is analyzed with SonarQube and Detekt on every PR.
- Do not commit secrets: `google-services.json`, API keys or keystores.
- Follow the Kotlin coding conventions and keep Compose screens small and previewable.
